# UI Alignment and Functionality Improvements

Fix the alignment of the "Pending" badge and make the "Members" count dynamic in the group list.

## Proposed Changes

### [Backend]

#### [MODIFY] [groups.sql](file:///c:/Users/ADRIAN/Github/skufu/PayUp/backend/sql/queries/groups.sql)
- Update `ListGroupsForUser` to include `member_count`.

#### [MODIFY] [groups.go](file:///c:/Users/ADRIAN/Github/skufu/PayUp/backend/internal/handlers/groups.go)
- Update [groupResponse](file:///c:/Users/ADRIAN/Github/skufu/PayUp/backend/internal/handlers/groups.go#31-36) struct to include `MemberCount`.
- Populate `MemberCount` in the [List](file:///c:/Users/ADRIAN/Github/skufu/PayUp/backend/internal/handlers/groups.go#57-84) handler.

### [Frontend]

#### [MODIFY] [types.ts](file:///c:/Users/ADRIAN/Github/skufu/PayUp/frontend/src/payup/types.ts)
- Add `memberCount?: number` to the [Group](file:///c:/Users/ADRIAN/Github/skufu/PayUp/frontend/src/payup/types.ts#9-15) type.

#### [MODIFY] [endpoints.ts](file:///c:/Users/ADRIAN/Github/skufu/PayUp/frontend/src/payup/api/endpoints.ts)
- Update [listGroups](file:///c:/Users/ADRIAN/Github/skufu/PayUp/frontend/src/payup/api/endpoints.ts#64-68) return type to include `memberCount`.

#### [MODIFY] [PayUpApp.tsx](file:///c:/Users/ADRIAN/Github/skufu/PayUp/frontend/src/payup/PayUpApp.tsx)
- Map `memberCount` from API response to the group list.

#### [MODIFY] [SideMenu.tsx](file:///c:/Users/ADRIAN/Github/skufu/PayUp/frontend/src/payup/components/modals/SideMenu.tsx)
- Use `group.memberCount` for displaying the number of members.

#### [MODIFY] [WalletView.tsx](file:///c:/Users/ADRIAN/Github/skufu/PayUp/frontend/src/payup/components/WalletView.tsx)
- Fix vertical alignment of the "Pending" badge by adding `items-baseline` or adjusting padding.


## Verification Plan

### Manual Verification
- Check the "Pending" badge alignment in the wallet view.
- Verify that the group list in the side menu shows the correct number of members for each group.
